<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Miss Anthony returns two weeks after starting furosemide and empagliflozin for newly diagnosed heart failure. She is less breathless and now climbs a flight of stairs with one pause instead of two. Her ankle swelling is gone by morning and returns only slightly in the evening. Her home weights have fallen steadily by about 1.7 kg. She has had no dizziness on standing, no excess thirst, and no genital itching or urinary symptoms since starting empagliflozin. She takes every dose and keeps a weight diary. Her echocardiogram and cardiology consultation were done this morning. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Less breathless on stairs; evening ankle swelling only</td></tr><tr><td>Weight diary</td><td>Down about 1.7 kg over two weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Medication tolerance</td><td>No dizziness, thirst, or genital or urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Adherence</td><td>Every dose taken</td></tr><tr><td>NYHA class</td><td>II, improved from II to III</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

