    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or fatigue beyond her usual after travel</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild evening ankle swelling; no chest pain, palpitations, or orthopnea</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Breathless after a flight of stairs; no cough or wheeze</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dysuria, genital itching, or urgency</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dizziness or lightheadedness on standing</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

